{"root":"aku","ipa":"/aku/","core":"第一人称代词，意为“我”。用于非正式场合或与亲近的人交谈，也常用于文学作品或祈祷中。","pos":["虚词"],"scenes":["高频","生活","教会"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/aku/","zh":"我","phrases":[{"t":"aku sendiri","zh":"我自己"},{"t":"aku juga","zh":"我也一样"},{"t":"milik aku","zh":"我的东西"}],"examples":[{"t":"Aku sedang belajar bahasa Indonesia.","zh":"我正在学习印尼语。"},{"t":"Tuhan, aku bersyukur atas hari ini.","zh":"主啊，我为今天献上感恩。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"aku","ipa":"/aku/","zh":"我（代词）","phrase":{"t":"aku dan kamu","zh":"我和你"},"example":{"t":"Aku ingin pergi ke pasar.","zh":"我想去市场。"}},{"w":"mengaku","ipa":"/məŋaku/","zh":"承认，声称","phrase":{"t":"mengaku kalah","zh":"认输"},"example":{"t":"Dia mengaku telah melakukan kesalahan itu.","zh":"他承认自己犯了那个错误。"}},{"w":"pengakuan","ipa":"/pəŋakuan/","zh":"承认，供认，认可","phrase":{"t":"pengakuan dosa","zh":"忏悔，认罪"},"example":{"t":"Dia membuat pengakuan di depan polisi.","zh":"他在警察面前做了供述。"}},{"w":"mengakui","ipa":"/məŋakui/","zh":"承认，认可（某事或某人）","phrase":{"t":"mengakui kesalahan","zh":"承认错误"},"example":{"t":"Pemerintah mengakui kedaulatan negara itu.","zh":"政府承认了那个国家的主权。"}},{"w":"diakui","ipa":"/diakui/","zh":"被承认，被认可","phrase":{"t":"diakui secara internasional","zh":"国际公认的"},"example":{"t":"Keahliannya sudah diakui oleh banyak orang.","zh":"他的专业能力已被许多人认可。"}}],"derSlugs":["aku","mengaku","pengakuan","mengakui","diakui"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:10:09.404Z","src":"base"}